n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & ={x}_{1}\\overset{―}{{y}_{1}}+{x}_{2}\\overset{―}{{y}_{2}}+{x}_{3}\\overset{―}{{y}_{3}} \\\\  & =i\\cdot (\\overset{―}{1+i})+(1+2i)\\cdot (\\overset{―}{-1})+(-i)\\cdot (\\overset{―}{-\\text{i}}) \\\\  & =i\\cdot (1-i)+(1+2i)\\cdot (-1)+(-i)\\cdot \\text{i} \\\\  & =(1+i)+(-1-2i)+1 \\\\  & =1-i.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357874 #edb/ref 1080 "-8-12\\text{i}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357874 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357874 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0f249c59-b32c-5e1f-8a73-39662bb8292d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357895 #edb/ref 1080 "I and II only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357895 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186357895 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1104a8cb-ad84-52f3-b50b-876c66edd164" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358061 #edb/ref 1080 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358061 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358061 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2329b63f-d510-5ea2-bd87-da0ae0af0541" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358330 #edb/ref 1080 "12+8\\text{i}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358330 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358330 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "43b90f1b-a8a0-5f06-b237-83d19006453d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358401 #edb/ref 1080 "-7-\\text{i}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358401 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358401 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4b922b8f-90f0-5bd8-9404-ff43b4baa638" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358641 #edb/ref 1080 "-11+9\\text{i}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358641 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358641 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "658ae874-b297-562b-8a62-02be270bace9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358874 #edb/ref 1080 "III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358874 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 175